TI IPC Resource Manager

%C [Specific options]

[Specific options]:
    Specific options are separated by commas

vring_base=base        VRING base physical address
vring_size=size        VRING window size

Examples:

Starts a TI IPC Resource Manager with default vring base address mentioned in the code.

%C

Starts a TI IPC Resource Manager with user specified vring base address and size
Note: The size differ per SoC.  J721E, J721S2 --> 0x1c00000. J7200 --> 0x800000, J784S4 --> 0x3000000, AM62x --> 0x300000, AM62A --> 0x300000, J722S --> 0x300000

%C vring_base=0xb0000000,vring_size=0x1c00000
